# Exceptions for pgvector/pgvector (compose.prod.yaml), checked by deploy/scripts/scan-images.sh. Each entry:
# the reason in a comment above it and an expiry date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD), after which Trivy reports the finding
# again. Remove entries when the image tag is moved to a build without them.

# gosu (usr/local/bin/gosu) is built with an old Go standard library. It only switches from root to the
# postgres user and execs the server at start: it parses no certificates, URLs, MIME, XML or HTTP and opens
# no connections, so none of these standard library vulnerabilities is reachable (the gosu maintainers'
# position, https://github.com/tianon/gosu/blob/master/SECURITY.md). The image is the only Go binary.
CVE-2025-61726 exp:2027-02-28
